1
00:00:14,928 --> 00:00:19,076
Quel plaisir de te voir, Marinette !
What a pleasure to see you, Marinette!

2
00:00:19,176 --> 00:00:24,116
Moi aussi. J’ai confiance en toi.
Me too. I trust you.

3
00:00:24,216 --> 00:00:28,052
Avec toi, je trouve le bonheur.
With you, I find happiness.

4
00:00:28,152 --> 00:00:32,468
Le respect et la patience sont importants.
Respect and patience are important.

5
00:00:32,568 --> 00:00:36,308
Je veux la paix, pas la dispute.
I want peace, not an argument.

6
00:00:36,408 --> 00:00:40,964
Tu as raison. Parlons calmement.
You’re right. Let’s talk calmly.

7
00:00:41,064 --> 00:00:45,188
Mon rêve, c’est de garder cette habitude.
My dream is to keep this habit.

8
00:00:45,288 --> 00:00:49,244
Alors, un peu de silence et du thé ?
Then, a little silence and some tea?
